            <p class="text-body leading-relaxed text-lg mb-4">
              Knowing your TDEE, you apply simple math. 1 pound (approx. 0.45 kg) of body fat is equivalent to about 3,500 calories of stored energy.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-left">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-500 mr-2 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 17h8m0 0V9m0 8l-8-8-4 4-6-6"></path></svg>
                <span class="text-body"><strong>To lose fat:</strong> Subtract 500 calories from your TDEE. You will safely and consistently lose about 1 pound a week.</span>
              </li>
